cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it and the SimPT-Power data release."
title: "PortugueseOPD: build, validation and release code for SimPT-Power, a public-data multi-voltage (0.4-400 kV) simulation database of mainland Portugal"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Minglei
    affiliation: University of Minho
version: simpt-power-2026.10.03-r3.1
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/MingLeiZhou/PortugueseOPD"
abstract: >-
  Acquisition, network-building, power-flow, validation and release code for
  SimPT-Power: the 60-400 kV core CORE-3787-REN with 31,492 solved 15-minute AC
  power-flow snapshots, medium-voltage root slices, secondary substations,
  four-wire and geographic low-voltage networks, and the frozen and public
  release tooling, plus example notebooks.
keywords:
  - power systems
  - power flow
  - distribution network
  - pandapower
  - open data
  - Portugal
references:
